# Point-in-time `az role definition list` exports kept for reference only.
# Nothing reads them: the authoritative role definitions live in
# Grant-JITPermissions.ps1. They carry real subscription GUIDs in their
# AssignableScopes, so they are ignored rather than tracked - otherwise they
# are one `git add .` away from being published.
src/JIT-AzAccess.json
src/JIT-AzAccess-Manager.json
